---
import DetailHeader from "../../components/DetailHeader.astro";
import DetailPostLayout from "../../layouts/DetailPostLayout.astro";
import CallToAction from "../../components/CallToAction.astro";
---
<DetailPostLayout
	title="BugScribe - Automated Bug Bounty Reporting | Febiadi Wisnu Akbar"
	description="An automated Bug Bounty reporting tool that streamlines the process of documenting and submitting vulnerabilities to platforms like HackerOne and Bugcrowd."
	keywords="BugScribe, Bug Bounty, Cybersecurity, CVSS, HackerOne, Bugcrowd, Febiadi Wisnu Akbar"
>
	<div class="post">
		<main class="post-wrapper">
			<DetailHeader
				tag="CYBERSECURITY"
				description="Vulnerability Documentation & Dynamic CVSS Scoring Engine">
				<h1 class="font-type">
					BugScribe
				</h1>
			</DetailHeader>

			<section>
				<div class="content">
					<div class="row desc">
						<div class="col-1a">
							<h3 class="post-title">Project Goal</h3>
							<p class="post-desc">
								BugScribe was designed to solve a major bottleneck for security researchers and penetration testers: report writing. Instead of spending hours formatting markdown, aligning proof-of-concepts, and manually calculating CVSS scores, BugScribe automates the entire workflow through guided, standardized vulnerability templates.
							</p>

							<h3 class="post-title" style="margin-top:2rem;">Engineering Challenges</h3>
							<p class="post-desc">
								Integrating a dynamic CVSS v3.1 scoring calculator required strict client-side vector validation. Complex matrix parameters (Attack Vector, Attack Complexity, Privileges Required, Scope, and Impact metrics) were modeled to compute and render precise severity ratings dynamically.
							</p>

							<h3 class="post-title" style="margin-top:2rem;">Key Technical Achievements</h3>
							<ul class="achievement-list">
								<li>Built standardized vulnerability report templates mapped directly to OWASP Top 10 and CWE categories.</li>
								<li>Integrated an interactive CVSS v3.1 vector calculator providing instantaneous severity calculations.</li>
								<li>Designed instant Markdown export drawers configured for direct submission into HackerOne and Bugcrowd.</li>
								<li>Engineered automated proof-of-concept payload sanitizers to strip sensitive tokens and personal data securely.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="col-1a" style="margin-top:2rem;">
							<div class="btn">
								<CallToAction href="https://bugscribe.vercel.app" target="_blank">
									Launch Production Version
								</CallToAction>
								<CallToAction href="https://github.com/rheatkhs" target="_blank">
									GitHub Repository
								</CallToAction>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</DetailPostLayout>

<style>
.achievement-list {
	list-style: disc;
	padding-left: 1.5rem;
	margin: 1rem 0;
	color: var(--color-200);
	line-height: 1.8;
}
.achievement-list li {
	margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
</style>
